# mspaint

## Added
- Entity ESP Fill toggle and Fill Transparency slider
- Camera FOV slider (60 - 120)
- Objective ESP: highlights levers at Room###.Scriptable.LeverModel
- Entity ESP & spawn notifier for Hisoka and Ambush
- Loading GUI that shows what is loading on start
- Floor tab that only appears on the Graveyard floor
- Graveyard restricts Entity ESP & notifier to Hisoka
- Changelog is now read from .changelog in the repository

## Changed
- Movement and Automation moved to the Character tab
- Removed Minecart Speed (RoamingCart is server-controlled)
- Ambush is now avoided by Avoid Entities
